---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import { BRAND } from '../../lib/data.ts';
---
<Base title={`Terms of Service | ${BRAND}`} description="The terms for using PlayPoolNation and sending us venue information." crumbs={[['Home', '/'], ['Terms of service', '']]} pageType="page">
  <div class="prose">
    <h1>Terms of service</h1>
    <p class="muted">Last updated: November 2026</p>
    <p>PlayPoolNation (playpoolnation.com) is operated by Justin Couch, Sioux Falls, SD ("we", "us"). By using the site you agree to these terms.</p>
    <h2>The directory</h2>
    <p>PlayPoolNation lists pool halls and bars with pool tables. We work to keep information accurate, but details such as hours, table counts, prices and league nights can change. Please confirm with the venue before you go. Listings are provided as-is, without warranties.</p>
    <h2>What you send us</h2>
    <p>When you add a venue, claim one or suggest an edit, you confirm the information is true to the best of your knowledge and that you have the right to share it. You let us display, edit and remove it on PlayPoolNation. We review submissions and may decline or remove anything that is inaccurate, misleading, offensive or unlawful. Venue owners who claim a listing must be authorized to manage that venue.</p>
    <h2>Liability</h2>
    <p>To the extent the law allows, we are not liable for indirect or consequential losses arising from use of the site.</p>
    <h2>Changes and contact</h2>
    <p>We may update these terms. The date above shows the latest version. These terms are governed by the laws of South Dakota. Questions: info@playpoolnation.com.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
